From 58c3c2c77812a60c84d201eebd4e4a5b6f150f8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 05:30:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Edit journal, task attribution and rotation
 reconciliation (F-208)

Fork of Grimoire's GObject Editor Tool for the Zeppelin server.

- Move src/ and conf/ to the repo root so AzerothCore's modules/* glob finds them
- Record every save in zep_edit_journal (one row per changed column, carrying the
  pre-edit value) so edits can be drained into a tagged zpak SQL file; the
  worldserver container has no mount for the content repo and cannot write it
- Require an F-xxx / I-xxx task id before any mutating action (TASK opcode)
- Report a rotation quaternion that disagrees with the orientation column, and
  add FIX_ROT to repair it explicitly rather than baking the mismatch in (I-359)
- Scope the PlayerScript to the two hooks it actually uses

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HFVDBFTZe7A38ajdcJeuN7
